	quest.1E54ADB365BD7C51.quest_desc: [
		"The otherside portal is the entrypoint to the Otherside. It follows the same shape as the nether portal, but has a minimum height of 2 instead of 3 by default, along with being composed of reinforced deepslate. Unlit otherside portals can be found in the center of an ancient city and in ancient temples."
		""
		"The otherside portal is opened with a heart of the deep instead of a flint and steel."
	]
	quest.1E666EDDB10E02CB.quest_desc: [
		"Burns fuel to charge any items at support Forge Energy (FE), which most mods support."
		""
		"- Burns any Fuel (Coal/Wood/etc). "
		"- 1 Coal = 20,000 RF (Similar to most other mods fuel levels). "
		"- Internal storage capacity of 1,000,000 RF"
		"- Burns fuel and charges a single item rather quickly."
		"- Meant as a stop gap measure to charge items you want to use before you get a fully fledged energy system going. "
		"- Doesn't waste fuels! Will stop burning a piece of fuel once the internal capacitor is full. "
	]
